  "summary": "An international team sequenced Andes virus from 10 of 13 cases in an April 2026 cruise ship outbreak. Genomes, symptom onset dates, and contact patterns fit one or very few spillovers before boarding, followed by spread between passengers. The virus is not an unusual strain. Three cases had no sequence, and the origin of the spillover is not identified here.",
